STYLE="white-space:nowrap">NGN-401</FONT> and its research stage opportunities; the expected dosing of additional patients in Neurogene&#146;s Phase 1/2 clinical trial; statements by Neurogene&#146;s Founder and Chief Executive Officer; statements
